# Implementation Plan - Finalize Certificate Branding & Issuance

The manual and automated verification revealed two blockers:
1.  **Missing Dependency**: The `barryvdh/laravel-dompdf` library is needed for PDF generation but is not installed.
2.  **Data Mismatch**: There was a discrepancy between the frontend completion state and the backend issuance logic (fixed in code but needs verification).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This plan will install `barryvdh/laravel-dompdf`. This is a stable, standard library for Laravel PDF generation.

## Proposed Changes

### System Configuration
#### [MODIFY] [composer.json](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/composer.json)
- Add `barryvdh/laravel-dompdf` to the requirements.

### Backend Refinement
#### [VERIFY] [CertificateController.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Certificates/app/Http/Controllers/CertificateController.php)
- Ensure it uses `LessonProgress` from `Modules\Enrollments\Models`.
- Ensure it correctly base64-encodes branding assets for PDF rendering.

#### [VERIFY] [CertificateTest.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Certificates/tests/Feature/CertificateTest.php)
- Ensure it seeds `lesson_progress` table correctly.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- `composer install` to fetch new dependencies.
- `php artisan test Modules/Certificates/tests/Feature/CertificateTest.php` to verify issuance and PDF download logic.

### Manual Verification
- **Admin Branding**: Navigate to `/admin/settings/branding`, update color/logo, and verify persistence.
- **Student Flow**: Finalize the "Mastering Laravel" course as `student@skillpilot.com` and download the branded certificate.
